# Company financials and legal records. These were tracked in a PUBLIC repo
# until 22 Aug 2026, and the six-partner shareholding split was readable from
# raw.githubusercontent.com without logging in - both from the workbooks and
# hardcoded in the generator scripts. Untracked, not deleted: the files are
# still on disk locally.
#
# Untracking only stops it getting WORSE. Git history still holds every one of
# these at their old commits, so they stay fetchable by SHA until the history
# is purged. See the security-posture note.
BAV GROUP ACCOUNTING/
company-materials/
*.xlsx

# These build the accounting workbooks and hardcode partner names against
# their percentages in plain source.
create_accounting_workbook.py
create_black_arrow_accounting.py
create_professional_accounting.py
create_professional_gsheet.py
black_arrow_final.py

# Superseded by downloads/profile.pdf, which is the one the site links.
company-profile.pdf
